    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/appointment-management/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Appointment Management Theme is a professional, responsive, and user-friendly solution designed to streamline online appointment booking for businesses of all sizes, including beauty salons, medical clinics, dental offices, law firms, wellness centers, fitness studios, gyms, yoga classes, physiotherapy centers, barber shops, massage therapists, spas, daycare centers, tutoring businesses, counseling services, veterinary clinics, automotive services, tattoo studios, home service providers, training institutes, and virtual consultation platforms. Tailored for service-based businesses and booking platforms, it offers advanced scheduling features like calendar sync, time slot selection, recurring bookings, group appointments, location-based scheduling, buffer time setup, booking rescheduling, cancellation handling, and multi-service booking. Clients can book and manage appointments effortlessly through intuitive booking forms, booking buttons, and widgets, while receiving automated confirmations, SMS/email reminders, and real-time notifications. This theme integrates seamlessly with tools like Google Calendar, Outlook, WooCommerce, PayPal, and Stripe to manage paid appointments securely and efficiently. Its clean, mobile-optimized layout ensures accessibility across all devices, making it easy for clients to schedule anywhere, anytime. Staff can manage availability, assign team members, track client records, and enforce no-show protection policies through an intuitive dashboard. Designed to boost conversions and user engagement, it includes branded appointment pages, testimonial sections, service listings, reviews, and customizable booking workflows. Fully compatible with the powerful Bookly plugin, this appointment booking theme delivers a scalable, high-performing, and conversion-focused platform for salons, clinics, coaches, consultants, and businesses looking to automate scheduling and elevate their client experience. https://demo.asterthemes.com/appointment-management/"
    },
